## ---
   aliases: [mail]
   group: Web
   icon: email
   ---
   Sends an email.
@to (Vector_Editor item_editor=Text_Input item_default="''")
@cc (Vector_Editor item_editor=Text_Input item_default="''")
@bcc (Vector_Editor item_editor=Text_Input item_default="''")
send from:Text="" (to:Vector Text)=[] (cc:Vector Text)=[] (bcc:Vector Text)=[] (subject:Text)="" (body:Email_Body)="" (attachments:Vector Email_Attachment)="" (provider:Email_Provider) =
    _ = [provider]
    email_object = Email_Object.Value from to cc bcc subject body attachments
    provider.send email_object
    